Line 1: "2th" isn't how that ordinal is written.
    say 2th 1nd 13rd 22th
        ^^^
Write "2nd".

Line 1: "1nd" isn't how that ordinal is written.
    say 2th 1nd 13rd 22th
            ^^^
Write "1st".

Line 1: "13rd" isn't how that ordinal is written.
    say 2th 1nd 13rd 22th
                ^^^^
Write "13th".

Line 1: "22th" isn't how that ordinal is written.
    say 2th 1nd 13rd 22th
                     ^^^^
Write "22nd".

Line 2: A number can't have letters stuck to it: "4.5th".
    say 4.5th
        ^^^^^
Put a space between them, like "4.5 th".
